ategories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"pSdCjt0waaO5ftFxtuyEDg","review_id":"IzCsHofTdPYoaVILaZ7r5g","date":"2019-12-22T16:11:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9304925799369812,"text_excerpt":"We arrived late in New Orleans and we were starving. Because we were staying right off of Bourbon Street, we started walking up and down looking for a little taste of the Big Easy. We walked past Le Bayou and one of the servers handed us a menu and invited us in. So glad we did, great place to eat! Hubby and I started off with a Hurricane - when in Rome.... Our daughter ordered the Shrimp Jambalaya. It was loaded with delicious gulf shrimp sautéed in New Orleans style barbecue sauce and topped on a gigantic bed of cajun Jambalaya rice. Delish! I ordered the Taste of the Bayou and chose 3 of the samplers - Chicken and Andouille Gumbo, Red Beans and Rice and the Cajun Jambalaya. Each one wa..."},{"business_id":"pSdCjt0waaO5ftFxtuyEDg","review_id":"OZp-y8BLpNOJ59a_1wnjMQ","date":"2021-10-09T17:51:33","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9259892702102661,"text_excerpt":"Really cool spot to get a bite to eat and a drink. They have a lot of seating and a good selection of menu items to choose from. The drinks also include the favorites: the Hurricane and the Madame Laveau. I got the Gulf Shrimp Ya-Ya and my boyfriend got the Cajun Boudin. Both were phenomenal but I think the gulf shrimp was the best. The gulf shrimp ya-ya came with bread and a delicious sauce that the shrimp were sautéed in that it made it so delicious and savory. Would definitely recommend for a quick bite if you're in the area. The restaurant is next to a bunch of cool stores and bars, so you're not far from other fun spots as well."},{"business_id":"pSdCjt0waaO5ftFxtuyEDg","review_id":"iYl7TkPjfC9JoyW3Ews_OA","date":"2019-02-10T22:52:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9243523478507996,"text_excerpt":"We went for late night dinner- had a group of 12 of us around 10pm. They were able to get us a table right away. Waiter was really nice and patient with us even though we had a big group and one of us spilled a beer . Had the taste of the bayou with jambalaya, gumbo and crawfish etouffee. Didn't actually know what etouffee was but it was my favorite of the 3! Reddish soup with a lot of flavor. Gumbo was my second favorite! Tasty and flavorful. The jambalaya was only ok, didn't have a ton of flavor or seasoning."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"pSdCjt0waaO5ftFxtuyEDg","photo_id":"A4Px_f45HHdhfXqe9ZfN1A","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/A4Px_f45HHdhfXqe9ZfN1A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9538276791572571},{"business_id":"pSdCjt0waaO5ftFxtuyEDg","photo_id":"P2x7JAbPTM_24e046crqnQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/P2x7JAbPTM_24e046crqnQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.845436692237854},{"business_id":"pSdCjt0waaO5ftFxtuyEDg","photo_id":"uNWN6ReNaB7xF3RkZdS4Og","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/uNWN6ReNaB7xF3RkZdS4Og.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8149774670600891},{"business_id":"pSdCjt0waaO5ftFxtuyEDg","photo_id":"dgz12bJ9pwU5hPCebsnBGg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/dgz12bJ9pwU5hPCebsnBGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7949184775352478}]},"notebook_case":null}
